# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual environment  (~2 GB, and it is machine-specific anyway)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trained models
#
# autism_detector.keras is ~107 MB, which is over GitHub's 100 MB per-file
# hard limit -- a push containing it is rejected outright. Models are also
# reproducible from the code, so they are not tracked. Use Git LFS or a
# GitHub Release if you genuinely need to distribute them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models/*.keras
Models/*.h5
Models/*.weights.h5

# ...except the exported inference-only model. At 44.5 MB it fits comfortably
# under the 100 MB limit, so anyone cloning the repo can predict immediately
# instead of retraining. Produced by: python export_model.py
!Models/neuroconnect_model.keras
!Models/model_config.json
!Models/class_names.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data
#
# The ABIDE-II archive is ~16 GB -- far too large for a repository, and
# regenerable by anyone who downloads it. ABIDE-II itself is licensed
# CC BY-NC-SA, so redistribution is permitted with attribution, for
# non-commercial use, under the same licence. On that basis four sample scans
# are shipped in SampleData/ (25 MB) so the app is runnable straight after
# cloning; the rest stays out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ABIDEII-*/
ABIDEII-*.csv
MAIN_Training1/
MAIN_Testing1/
MAIN_Testing1_WholeMRI/
*.nii
*.nii.gz

# ...except the four sample scans (see SampleData/README.md for licence terms)
!SampleData/
!SampleData/*.nii.gz

# Run artefacts that reference local paths / specific patients
dataset_manifest.json
train_val_split.json
train_run.log
*.log

# Generated reports (regenerated by train_model.py / test_model.py)
Reports/*.png
Reports/*.txt
Reports/*.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
~$*
